=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Justinius} on the top floor of {z:Tavnazian Safehold} to activate the quest and receive a {k:Monarch Linn Patrol Permit}.
** Every member of the alliance needs a {k:Monarch Linn Patrol Permit}. The key item is needed to enter the BCNM and will vanish upon entrance.
* Travel to {z:Monarch Linn}.
** Fastest way is through {p:Riverne - Site #B01|Riverne - Site B01} {p:Home Point} and interacting with the **Spatial Displacement**.
** If you do not have the {p:Riverne - Site #B01|Riverne - Site B01} {p:Home Point}, you will need 2 {i:Giant Scales|Giant Scale|1691} to get through Riverne - Site #A01 or 1 {i:Giant Scale|Giant Scale|1691} to get through Riverne - Site #B01.
*** {i:Giant Scale|Giant Scale|1691} is an EX drop from {m:Firedrakes|Firedrake} or {m:Ignidrakes|Ignidrake}.

=2 Fight Details
* The BCNM is scaled acording to the number of members in the alliance. One additional Mammet will appear every 2 members in the alliance: For a 1-2 member party, 1 Mammet will spawn. For a 3-4 member party 2 Mammets will spawn, and so on, for a maximum of 9 Mammets.
* The Mammet-800 opponents have access to the same abilities as the {m:Mammet-19 Epsilon} in {M:Promathia Mission 2-5|Promathia Mission 2-5|Ancient Vows}, though scaled up in difficulty for this uncapped fight.
** {i:Yellow Liquid|Yellow Liquid|5264} will still lock a Mammet-800 into its current form temporarily. The Mammet-800 can drop 0-3 {i:Yellow Liquid|Yellow Liquid|5264} each.
* The Mammet-800 will change stance when a PC enters the grassy arena. From this point, you have 1 minute until they attack your alliance, regardless of whether you have performed any action against them.
* The fight ends as soon as the last Mammet-800 is defeated.

=2 Rewards
* Return to {n:Justinius} after winning the fight to receive your reward.
** Other rewards can include (less frequently than {i:Miratete's Memoirs}): {i:Behemoth Hide|Behemoth Hide|860}, {i:Angel Skin|Angel Skin|1312}, {i:Bison Steak|Bison Steak|5142}, {i:Cloud Evoker|Cloud Evoker|1842}, {i:Dragon Bone|Dragon Bone|1771}, {i:Dragon Heart|Dragon Heart|4486}, {i:Mannequin Hands|Mannequin Hands|1603}, {i:Orichalcum Ore|Orichalcum Ore|739}, {i:Oversized Fang|Oversized Fang|1770}, {i:Raxa|Raxa|1132}, {i:Sea Spray Risotto|Sea Spray Risotto|4268}, and {i:Unicorn Horn|Unicorn Horn|1841}.
* This quest can be repeated after every Conquest tally.

